:: Street killer - group lost [Place bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">STREETS</h1>
<br />
<center>
    <<image 'places/underground/street_killer_group_lost.jpg'>>
</center>
<br /><br />
You got out. That was the best that could be said for it.
<br /><br />
They caught you with more than you expected and you took hits you couldn't absorb. At some point your body made the decision for you and you ran — through a side passage, over rubble, until the sound of boots behind you stopped.
<br /><br />
You sat against a wall somewhere you didn't recognise and waited for the ringing to stop.
<br /><br />
They were still out there. And now they knew someone was looking.
<br /><br />
<<energy -30>>
<<unset $game.streetsKilledNpc>>
<<link 'Drag yourself home'>>
    <<goto 'Underground city'>>
<</link>>
